{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"screen\": \"熟悉的舞曲气息又现，却不再像最初那样立起秩序\",\n      \"source\": \"182–197小节，也可以听成先前那些更有宣告意味、带着波兰舞曲气息的声音再次出现；只是它已不再像最初那样，以完整而鲜明的姿态建立秩序。\",\n      \"type\": 2,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿明确将其作为一种可选的听法，屏幕稿却直接写成舞曲气息再次出现，取消了原来的解释余地。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"screen\": \"可回去也未必能像从前\",\n      \"source\": \"可就算真的回去，还能像从前那样吗？\",\n      \"type\": 1,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿保留了对回去后能否恢复从前的疑问，屏幕稿改成了对结果的判断。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"screen\": \"这份挺立不是假装没受过伤，而是经历动摇后仍选择怎样站立\",\n      \"source\": \"这份挺立也可以听成经历动摇后的主动选择：即使知道自己会犹疑、疲惫、想念，仍然可以决定怎样站立。它不要求人假装自己从未受过伤。\",\n      \"type\": 2,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿只是提出一种可选的理解，屏幕稿用“不是……而是……”将这种理解写成了确定的解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"screen\": \"像在轻问：刚建立的东西真的牢固了吗？\",\n      \"source\": \"仿佛刚刚建立的成功又被轻轻问了一句：它真的已经牢固了吗？\",\n      \"type\": 8,\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"把具体的“成功”泛化成“东西”，丢失了原来被质疑的是刚刚建立的成功这一层意思。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d3b06ab8-3a21-45ce-a9bb-9a98ab8032c5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T070502320900Z", "elapsed_seconds": 445.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T07:12:28.253664+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "762aa13c5bc42e8de9da2a1407109a7cc7b5091d95ad31f1ee2f5d589d0788ee", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T070502320900Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e4aa57951d831e0a5c86da876a0755a0ad559a24fbaac1cabe87bfdf64f55c96"}}}
